		"@eng:effect_description: A vibrant energy effect combining a rotating polygonal mesh with cascading sparkle particles and layered glow elements. Features a geometric wire-frame sphere that spins while surrounded by bright twinkling particles, creating a powerful arcane or electric energy aesthetic ideal for charged abilities, power-ups, or magical energy sources.\\n\\ntags: magic, spell, fantasy, purple, glow, sparkle, electric, energy, polygon, mesh, arcane, power, charge, aura, mystical\\n\\n---\\n\\nSuggested Presets:\\n\\n[Default Energy Orb]\\nA balanced arcane energy orb perfect for charged abilities\\nParams: GlobalScale=1.0, PolygonSpinSpeed=60.0, PolygonScale=1.0, GlowScale=2.0\\n\\n[Subtle Enchantment]\\nA gentle, understated magical glow for passive effects\\nParams: GlobalScale=0.6, PolygonSpinSpeed=30.0, PolygonScale=0.7, GlowScale=1.0\\n\\n[Power Surge]\\nAn intense, fast-spinning energy effect for powerful abilities\\nParams: GlobalScale=1.5, PolygonSpinSpeed=150.0, PolygonScale=1.5, GlowScale=4.0\\n\\n[Electric Arc]\\nRapid spinning with bright sparkles for electric/lightning effects\\nParams: GlobalScale=1.2, PolygonSpinSpeed=200.0, DotsLifetime=0.3, StripsLifetime=0.2\\n\\n[Ambient Magic]\\nSlow, gentle ambient magical energy for environmental effects\\nParams: GlobalScale=0.8, PolygonSpinSpeed=15.0, PolygonScale=0.8, GlowScale=3.0\\n",
